  "issue_comments": [
    {
      "body": "#47254 ports #42092 (merged on `amd_march`) to `main`, so RDNA servers start with default flags. It also covers the Lean LDS overflow that #46912 addresses. Tested on RDNA4 with data in #47254; on CDNA the default is unchanged. cc @z2z23n0: this overlaps your fix for the same symptom here, and #47254 limits the change to gfx11xx/gfx120x via `is_rdna`, so gfx1250 stays on aiter. Happy to consolidate whichever way the maintainers prefer.\n",
